{"about_the_game":"15th Century, Europe. In a time where people held many views on how the world looked like, but no one to confirm. You play the role as the Master of a Trading Company, and your aim is to complete the World Map and tell the world what the &quot;world&quot; really is, via the help of the admirals you hire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532690/extras/2280ba7200a17a6969a5fc5514e9888c.avif?t=1634718292\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>As a Trader, you listen to your admirals' reports, and draw your very own World Map from there.<br>Some reports may be mundane but valid, while some may sound like they've fought mythical creatures like krakens or whatnots. Depending on what you believe and approve, your World Map takes shape. <br>And depending on how you choose your approvals, your World may end up very differently.<br><br>It may end up like this...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532690/extras/bb92f835eca2492bd2f5bf2d4859363d.avif?t=1634718292\" width=640 height=362 /></span><br><br>Or even end up like this!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532690/extras/f5d73b95e0a992ca2e0e3884509a7e0a.avif?t=1634718292\" width=640 height=362 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Establishing Trade Routes</h2>You need to pay your admirals wages, and keeping a functioning fleet does not come cheap.<br>As you progress in the game, you will discover more exotic produces from newly uncovered lands. Set up new trade routes and make a nice profit out of them!<br>Also, by establishing trade routes which allow specific combinations of produces to interact, it may result in the emergence of a new product, which you can then trade it for even bigger profits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532690/extras/278246f93b89f32a207b79b7f85eb5b3.avif?t=1634718292\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and uncover the World</h2>The core objective of the game is to chart out the World Map. Command your admirals to explore the foreign seas, and they will bring back reports of their findings at the end of their voyage. Your sole decision to &quot;Approve&quot; or &quot;Disapprove&quot; their reports is the key to shape the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532690/extras/09616893b9433f8040df8caeda113ade.avif?t=1634718292\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dowse for hidden treasures!</h2>Many treasures are hidden all over the world, waiting for you to dig them up. However, it can be quite a chore to be scouring the entire map, so here is a handy tool for you to detect treasures for more efficient treasure hunting!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532690/extras/6a297d38ab3e6b4722717297b39a0ea5.avif?t=1634718292\" width=640 height=360 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a9cb5619355e604f1ffc6a2edfa68bd6c5e8192a.jpg","localized_name":"Achievement King","name":"Achievement King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/a9cb5619355e604f1ffc6a2edfa68bd6c5e8192a.jpg"},{"icon":"9d3fc4b3b131647f4ba5ce534580affa6fa320b1.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Peres Recruited","name":"Admiral Peres Recruited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/9d3fc4b3b131647f4ba5ce534580affa6fa320b1.jpg"},{"icon":"0042c819c10886b3e1202d516a8b5413e9210877.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral G\u00f3mez Returns","name":"Admiral G\u00f3mez Returns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/0042c819c10886b3e1202d516a8b5413e9210877.jpg"},{"icon":"a906472fa930aedfe3baa59e640541bc434532d2.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Maria Recruited","name":"Admiral Maria Recruited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/a906472fa930aedfe3baa59e640541bc434532d2.jpg"},{"icon":"6afc78cad7638ffdbddbaed55df78d8ae42171fa.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Baldi Recruited","name":"Admiral Baldi Recruited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/6afc78cad7638ffdbddbaed55df78d8ae42171fa.jpg"},{"icon":"6ed470451f733a888312c30735eb2aea5d099152.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Barbosa Recruited","name":"Admiral Barbosa Recruited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/6ed470451f733a888312c30735eb2aea5d099152.jpg"},{"icon":"bc3ae1ba71613449ba9d889cd5f1fd4e8f58b33f.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Abtu Recruited","name":"Admiral Abtu Recruited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/bc3ae1ba71613449ba9d889cd5f1fd4e8f58b33f.jpg"},{"icon":"51b88eb48b44f891c2c80ab1e839c79bac65c8e4.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Solis Returns","name":"Admiral Solis Returns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/51b88eb48b44f891c2c80ab1e839c79bac65c8e4.jpg"},{"icon":"25e9fb0b2d77284acb32533b0d536fb4633ee733.jpg","localized_name":"Admiral Rojas Returns","name":"Admiral Rojas Returns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/25e9fb0b2d77284acb32533b0d536fb4633ee733.jpg"},{"icon":"d611e98290d9081582cb8c1c9c9732fd358029d2.jpg","localized_name":"Trade Contract Complete","name":"Trade Contract Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/532690/d611e98290d9081582cb8c1c9c9732fd358029d2.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/